      "id": "trading-in-the-zone-s024-p00692",
      "source_en": "Agree Disagree 14. As much as I might try to \"let go,\" I find it very difficult to put past emotional wounds behind me. Agree Disagree 15. I have a money management philosophy that is founded in the principle of always taking some money out of the market when the market makes it available. Agree Disagree 16. A trader s job is to identify patterns in the markets' behavior that represent an opportunity and then to determine the risk of finding out if these patterns will play themselves out as they have in the past. Agree Disagree",
